# `.codegen` must never be committed

The local zero-codegen tool lives under **`.codegen/`**. It is synced from `zero-apps-codegen-scaffold` and is **gitignored**.

## Rules

- Never `git add .codegen` (or any path under it).
- Never push `.codegen` to GitHub.
- After cloning this repo, sync codegen locally before running `pnpm codegen:*`:

```bash
rsync -a --exclude node_modules --exclude .git \
  /path/to/zero-apps-codegen-scaffold/.codegen/ ./.codegen/
pnpm codegen:paths
```

- Bundled OpenAPI under `packages/openapi-core/src/.bundled/` is also generated locally and gitignored.
- If a PR accidentally includes `.codegen`, remove it before merge.
